HEADER    MULTI-MODEL TRAJECTORY FIXTURE
TITLE     MOLECULENS TRAJECTORY TEST FIXTURE - 3 MODELS X 4 ATOMS
REMARK    Hand-written fixture: 3 MODEL/ENDMDL blocks, identical topology,
REMARK    coordinates translated by +1 A along X in each successive model.
REMARK    Used by tests/entity/trajectory to verify frame count, first/last
REMARK    frame coordinates and random-access consistency without needing a
REMARK    binary trajectory file.
MODEL        1
ATOM      1  C   MOL A   1       0.000   0.000   0.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM      2  O   MOL A   1       1.200   0.000   0.000  1.00  0.00           O
ATOM      3  N   MOL A   1       0.000   1.200   0.000  1.00  0.00           N
ATOM      4  H   MOL A   1       0.000   0.000   1.200  1.00  0.00           H
ENDMDL
MODEL        2
ATOM      1  C   MOL A   1       1.000   0.000   0.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM      2  O   MOL A   1       2.200   0.000   0.000  1.00  0.00           O
ATOM      3  N   MOL A   1       1.000   1.200   0.000  1.00  0.00           N
ATOM      4  H   MOL A   1       1.000   0.000   1.200  1.00  0.00           H
ENDMDL
MODEL        3
ATOM      1  C   MOL A   1       2.000   0.000   0.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM      2  O   MOL A   1       3.200   0.000   0.000  1.00  0.00           O
ATOM      3  N   MOL A   1       2.000   1.200   0.000  1.00  0.00           N
ATOM      4  H   MOL A   1       2.000   0.000   1.200  1.00  0.00           H
ENDMDL
END
